[{"title":"DevOps And Security Consultant","company":"Latitude Technolabs","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-devops-and-security-consultant-latitude-technolabs-ahmedabad-1-to-6-years-160926503994","source":"naukri","experience":"1-6 Yrs","skills":[1,14,15,16,17,18,19,20,34,107,116],"is_walkin":false,"description":"About Latitude Latitude Technolabs is a digital solutions company based in Ahmedabad, India, offering a range of services including mobile and web development, ERP solutions, UI/UX design, and digital marketing. The company has a global presence with offices in the USA, Switzerland, and Australia, and has completed over 500 web applications and 100 mobile apps across various industries. Job Role: We are seeking a highly motivated and skilled DevOps Security Consultant with 1+ year of hands-on experience in CI/CD automation, Terraform-based infrastructure provisioning, Linux administration, cloud infrastructure, and security best practices. The ideal candidate will help design, implement, automate, monitor, and secure scalable infrastructure and deployment pipelines for cloud-based applications. Role + Responsibilities: Design, implement, and manage Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using Terraform for cloud environments such as AWS, Azure, or GCP. Develop and maintain CI/CD pipelines using tools like Jenkins, GitLab CI/CD, GitHub Actions, or Azure DevOps. Work closely with development teams to support application deployment, monitoring troubleshooting, and performance tuning. Perform Linux system administration, configuration, monitoring, and troubleshooting. Monitor and troubleshoot Linux systems, including CPU, memory, disk, processes, networking, services, and system logs. Manage Linux users, permissions, packages, services, processes, cron jobs, and basic system configurations. Conduct security assessments, vulnerability scans, and implement security controls for infrastructure and CI/CD pipelines. Integrate DevSecops practices into the DevOps lifecycle while ensuring compliance with security policies. Maintain configuration management and automate system configurations using tools like Ansible or Chef. Monitor infrastructure using Prometheus, Grafana, ELK Stack, or similar monitoring tools. Troubleshoot infrastructure, deployment, networking, and system-related issues to ensure high availability. Implement and maintain secure cloud infrastructure following security and operational best practices. Collaborate with cross-functional teams to improve automation, reliability, scalability, and infrastructure performance. Person Specification and Qualifications: 1+ year of hands-on experience in DevOps practices, with exposure to Terraform and Cloud Infrastructure. Good knowledge of Linux administration and troubleshooting. Strong understanding of Linux commands, processes, services, permissions, networking, logs, and system performance. Proficiency in managing cloud environments such as AWS, Azure, or GCP. Experience with CI/CD tools such as Jenkins, GitLab CI/CD, GitHub Actions, or Azure DevOps. Basic to good scripting knowledge using Shell, Bash, or Python. Good understanding of Terraform and Infrastructure as Code (IaC). Good understanding of cloud security principles, including IAM, VPC, security groups, encryption, and compliance. Experience with infrastructure monitoring, logging, and alerting. Basic understanding of Git and version control systems. Familiarity with Docker and Kubernetes. Strong troubleshooting, analytical, and problem-solving skills. Ability to work independently as well as collaboratively within a team. Plus Points (Nice-to-Have) Terraform Associate (HashiCorp) certification. AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner / AWS Certified DevOps Engineer. Azure DevOps Engineer Expert certification. Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA). Security+ or equivalent security certification. Hands-on experience with Ansible. Knowledge of Docker Kubernetes administration. Experience with Prometheus, Grafana, ELK Stack, or similar monitoring tools. Basic understanding of Networking concepts, DNS, HTTP/HTTPS, TCP/IP, Load Balancing, and VPNs. Experience with cloud security and DevSecOps tools and practices. \n\nDisclaimer: This job posting has been aggregated from external source. Role details, content, and availability are subject to change. Applicants are advised to confirm the latest information directly on the company website before applying.\n\nKey Skills: Performance tuning,ERP,Automation,Linux,Networking,Configuration management,Web development,DNS"},{"title":"DevOps Engineer","company":"Xceltec","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-devops-engineer-xceltec-ahmedabad-1-to-2-years-160926933831","source":"naukri","experience":"1-2 Yrs","skills":[15,19,20],"is_walkin":false,"description":"cannot scrape description\n\nKey Skills: DevOps,Jenkins,Automation,Azure,Cloud Engineer,DevOps Engineer,GitLab CI,CI/CD"},{"title":"DevOps Engineer","company":"TechBlocks","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-07-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-devops-engineer-techblocks-consulting-pvt-ltd-ahmedabad-5-to-10-years-070726906677","experience":"5-10 Yrs","skills":[1,3,16,17,18,19,20,34,35,100,104]},{"title":"Associate DevOps / Cloud Implementation Engineer (Freshers)","company":"Devangles Software","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-07-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-associate-devops-cloud-implementation-engineer-freshers-devangles-infotech-ahmedabad-0-to-1-years-070726502093","skills":[16,17,18,20,34]},{"title":"Linux/DevOps Engineer","company":"Sharkstriker","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-07-07","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-linux-devops-engineer-sharkstriker-ahmedabad-1-to-2-years-070726501164","experience":"1-2 Yrs","skills":[1,17,18,34]},{"title":"Azure DevOps Engineer","company":"Technource","location":"Ahmedabad